  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.grudge.3": "Mark my words, %1$s will get what's coming.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.grudge.4": "I'd pay good emeralds to see %1$s get a thumping.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.grudge.5": "One day, %1$s. One day.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.grudge.6": "Is there no one who'll stand up to %1$s?",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.grudge.7": "I need a stranger for this. Someone with fists.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.0": "Oh? You've something to show me?",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.1": "Lead on, then. This had better be good.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.2": "A surprise? For me? All right!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.3": "Where are we going?",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.4": "I've a little time. Show me.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.5": "Not too far, mind.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.6": "You seem trustworthy enough. Lead the way.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.7": "Ooh, I love a mystery.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.0": "Hmph. Never mind, then.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.1": "Wait up! ...Oh, forget it.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.2": "I've better things to do.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.3": "Where did they go? Bah.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.4": "Some surprise that was.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.5": "I'm going home.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.6": "I'm not walking all day!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.lure.lost.7": "Rude. Leaving me behind.",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.0": "Got you now, %1$s!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.1": "Surprise, %1$s!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.2": "Remember me, %1$s?",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.3": "You had this coming!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.4": "Now we'll talk!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.5": "No one to run to now!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.6": "This is for the market!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.ambush.7": "Thought you'd get away with it?",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.mercy.0": "Enough! Enough, I yield!",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.mercy.1": "Who sent you?! Was it them?",
  "neighbours.jaymoskingdoms.mercy.2": "Stop! Please!",
